nootropics because it translates

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.850
to smart drugs, and to be direct again,

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.890
there is no such thing as a smart drug.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.990
That is there's no such thing as a drug

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:18.720
that can make you smarter
because there is no circuit

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.980
in the brain for being smart.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.360
There are circuits in the brain for focus.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.730
There are circuits in the
brain for task switching.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:26.070
There are circuits in the
brain related to creativity

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.330
and so on and so forth.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.640
So the idea that there
would be a single smart drug

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.640
or nootropic is simply foolish.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:36.240
And fortunately Thesis
understands this and therefore has

