Although we might be.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.720
There are things associated
with smoking and with vaping and

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.840
other means of getting
nicotine into our system

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.390
that have their own
effects, both negative,

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:12.030
and in some cases positive.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:12.863
Indeed later,

00:15:12.863 --> 00:15:15.630
